    "Mean Arterial Pressure (from Cardiac Output and Peripheral Resistance)" : "平均动脉压（由心输出量和外周阻力求得）",
    "Mean arterial pressure" : "平均动脉压",
    "Molal boiling point elevation constant" : "质量摩尔沸点升高常数",
    "Molal freezing point depression constant" : "质量摩尔凝固点降低常数",
    "Molar Heat Capacity at Constant Pressure (Monatomic Ideal Gas)" : "定压摩尔热容（单原子理想气体）",
    "Molar Heat Capacity at Constant Volume (Monatomic Ideal Gas)" : "定容摩尔热容（单原子理想气体）",
    "Molar Mass from Boiling Point Elevation" : "由沸点升高求摩尔质量",
    "Molar Mass from Freezing Point Depression" : "由凝固点降低求摩尔质量",
    "Molar Mass from Osmotic Pressure" : "由渗透压求摩尔质量",
    "Molar mass of fat" : "脂肪的摩尔质量",
    "Molar mass of fat (triglyceride)" : "脂肪（甘油三酯）的摩尔质量",
    "Molarity from Mass Percent and Density" : "由质量分数和密度求摩尔浓度",
    "Molecular Clock: Divergence Time" : "分子钟：分歧时间",
    "Molecular Clock: Substitution Rate" : "分子钟：替代速率",
    "Molecular Formula Multiplier from Empirical Formula" : "由实验式求分子式倍数",
    "Molecular mass (from vapor density etc.)" : "分子量（由蒸气密度等测得）",
    "Monozygotic twin concordance rate" : "同卵双胞胎同病率",
    "Nerve Impulse Conduction Velocity (Two-Point Stimulation)" : "神经冲动传导速度（双点刺激法）",
    "Net Reproductive Rate (R0, Two Age Classes)" : "净繁殖率（R0，两个年龄组）",
    "Non-relativistic approximation; becomes inaccurate when the resulting speed approaches a significant fraction of the speed of light (roughly above 10% of c, i.e. very high accelerating voltages for light particles like electrons)." : "非相对论近似；当所得速度接近光速的相当一部分时（大致超过光速c的10%，即对电子等轻粒子而言加速电压非常高时），该近似将变得不准确。",
    "Number of C=C double bonds per molecule" : "每分子中C=C双键的数目",
    "Number of bond type 1 broken" : "断裂的第1类键数目",
    "Number of bond type 1 formed" : "生成的第1类键数目",
    "Number of bond type 2 broken" : "断裂的第2类键数目",
    "Number of bond type 2 formed" : "生成的第2类键数目",
    "Number of molecules" : "分子数目",
    "Number of recombinant offspring" : "重组型子代数",
    "One-dimensional momentum conservation only; assumes no external forces act during the (near-instantaneous) separation event." : "仅适用于一维动量守恒；假设在（近乎瞬时的）分离过程中不受外力作用。",
    "Orbiting body mass" : "运动天体质量",
